  "raw_label": "postponed_or_procedural",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sheetal Dhariwal vs Union Of India & Ors on 4 March, 2024 Author: Manmeet Pritam Singh Arora Bench: Manmeet Pritam Singh Arora $~42 * In The High Court Of Delhi At New + W.P.(C) 3208/2024 & Cm Appl. 13174 Sheetal Dhariwal Union Of India & Ors. Coram: Hon'Ble The Acting Chief Justice Hon'Ble Ms. Justice Manmeet Pritam Singh Arora Order % 04.03.2024 Cm Appl. 13174/2024 (for exemption) Allowed, subject to all just exceptions.",
    "facts": "Present public interest litigation has been filed seeking compliance of Regulation 2.3.4 of the Food Safety and Standards (Prohibition and Restrictions on Sales) Regulations, 2011 which prohibits use of tobacco and nicotine as ingredients in any food product. However, no empirical data has been placed on record by the Petitioner to show that the product in question uses Sheetal Dhariwal vs Union Of India & Ors on 4 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/70382760/ 1 tobacco and nicotine as ingredients. The Petitioner has not even impleaded Food Safety and Standards Authority of India (FSSAI) which is the regulator under the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
